     2	per session, each marked COMPLETE / INCOMPLETE with its reason, and a
     3	mechanical session verdict written to <evidence>/session_status.json.
     4	An INCOMPLETE session is reported as such; it is never salvaged by relaxing
     5	validation or timing requirements.
