   277	  **Provenance gate:** every process verifies the msst clone (HEAD = pin,
   278	  clean), the checkpoint sha256, the registered config path and the
   279	  explicit `use_amp` before building; the session preflight writes ONE
   280	  immutable `session_manifest.json` (repo commit + clean tree, sha256 of
   281	  this registration, of every measuring file, the clip manifest, pins,
   282	  environment) that every run and every reference is bound to; a mismatch
   283	  refuses the run.
   284	  **Headline rule:** a cell publishes a headline only if restarts r1, r2 AND
