     8	
     9	Phase order in main() (timed region excludes everything before step 6):
    10	    0 provenance gate (pins verified) + session-manifest binding
    11	    1 load the public model (loader.py)
    12	    2 build the arm step (fullarms.py): compile / capture / swaps happen here
    13	    3 settle (compile arms: until Dynamo counters stop moving, logged) or warmup
    14	    4 graph gate (compile arms; C3/H require zero graph breaks or INVALID)
    15	    5 validate vs the SAVED eager-A outputs (two seeds, different data)
    16	    6 timed region: five repeats of the 5a block (timing.five_repeats)
    17	    7 SDR gate (--sdr) AFTER the timed region (registered placement)
    18	    8 one JSON per run: <evidence>/full_<arm>_c<chunk>_<tag>.json with
    19	      headline_eligible + machine-readable reasons
    20	
    21	Counter snapshots are taken after settle, after validation, before and
    22	after timing, after SDR; all are preserved. A validation FAIL, a graph-gate
    23	FAIL, an unstable recording state, or an exception marks the run INVALID /
    24	ineligible in its JSON and exits 0 (the session continues, loudly).
    25	"""
    26	
    27	import argparse
    28	import json
    29	import os
    30	import sys
    31	import traceback
